    {
      "t": "S",
      "v": "\"N'est-ce pas le jour où D.B. Cooper a détourné un avion ?\" ",
      "n": "CorrectText"
    },
    {
      "t": "S",
      "v": "S+5.38 ",
      "n": "$QuestionAudio$QuestionTextCue2"
    },
    {
      "t": "S",
      "v": "2,0,1,3 ",
      "n": "MCOrder"
    },
    {
      "t": "S",
      "v": "que diriez-vous ? ",
      "n": "QuestionText2"
    },
    {
      "t": "S",
      "v": "Before",
      "n": "BumperPlacement"
    },
    {
      "t": "S",
      "v": "If anybody were to ask where I was on Nov. 24, 1971...",
      "n": "QuestionText1"
    },
    {
      "s": "Une question avec une arrière-pensée ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "761852_1",
      "n": "CategoryAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Oh, je veux croire que tu dirais ça, c'est vraiment le cas. Mais le fait est que vous en savez trop. Sortons votre score pour un bon long trajet... ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "761864_3",
      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio3"
    },
    {
      "s": "Hé, donc juste hypothétiquement... ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "761853_1",
      "n": "IntroAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "761855_2",
      "n": "ChoicesAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Cela s’est produit dans les années 30, donc je doute que les flics croient que vous êtes si stupide, malgré toutes les preuves du contraire. ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "761862_4",
      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio2"
    },
    {
      "s": "Vous avez environ 20 ans de retard. Tout comme ces croquis de police. ",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "761860_3",
      "n": "WrongAnswerAudio1"
    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "n": "Intro2Audio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Oh yeah, I guess the criminal known as D.B. Cooper hijacked a plane and stole $200,000 on Nov. 24, 1971, and then vanished without a trace. Weird.",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "761857_3",
      "n": "ExplanationAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Not that I was trying to get an alibi from you or anything. I’m just saying maybe some of this old soggy money just HAPPENS to find its way to your score...",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "761858_1",
      "n": "JokeAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "If anybody were to ask where I was on Nov. 24, 1971, what would you say?",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "761854_1",
      "n": "QuestionAudio"
    }
  ]
